WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.736
-We're about to play
"The Whisper Challenge."

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:05.838
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:07.573
[ Indistinct whispering ]

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:11.044
-Whisper Challenge.

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:12.845
-Wow. Now, here's how
the game works.

00:00:12.845 --> 00:00:16.015
One person puts on headphones
with loud music playing.

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:18.884
Then the other person
picks up a card, okay,

00:00:18.884 --> 00:00:20.787
and reads a random
word or phrase,

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:22.088
and the person
wearing the headphones

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:24.657
has to try to guess
what they had just said.

00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:26.459
So, you can play this at home
if you want.

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:28.628
Salma, you put
the headphones on first,

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:30.329
and I will read you a phrase.

00:00:30.329 --> 00:00:32.565
And you're going to guess
what I'm saying.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:36.636
-Okay, but, let's just
disclaimer --

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:39.238
not good at linguistic games.

00:00:39.238 --> 00:00:41.073
Not good at whispering, either.

00:00:41.073 --> 00:00:43.676
-Oh, my gosh.

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:44.711
-Is he talking to me now?

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:47.914
-You can't whisper, either?

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:50.216
Oh, my gosh. Nope, not yet.

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:52.986
By the way, who looks
that awesome in headphones,

00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:55.220
by the way? Oh, my God.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:55.220 --> 00:00:56.422
-Is he talking to me?

00:00:56.422 --> 00:00:58.524
-No. No.

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:00.827
Mm? Mm? Mm? Mm?

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.769
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.173 --> 00:01:16.509
[ Laughter ]

